flowchart TB
  subgraph Client["Client boundary"]
    direction LR
    Wallets["Borrower / officer / admin<br/>wallets"]
    DApp["React DApp<br/>Role-based workspaces"]
    Wallets -->|connect and sign| DApp
  end

  subgraph OffChain["Trusted off-chain boundary"]
    direction LR
    Registry[("Mock property registry")]
    Oracle["Oracle API<br/>Rules and commitments"]
    Prover["Groth16 prover<br/>WASM + proving key"]
    Oracle -->|read| Registry
    Oracle -->|prove| Prover
  end

  subgraph OnChain["On-chain contract boundary"]
    direction LR
    RoleAdminManager["RoleAdminManager"]
    Lending["Lending<br/>Loan state and locks"]
    PropertyVerification["PropertyVerification<br/>Owner, Cv, Cp, status"]
    ComplianceVerifier["ComplianceVerifier<br/>Signal binding"]
    LtvGroth16Verifier["LtvGroth16Verifier<br/>Proof verification"]
    Lending -->|read state| PropertyVerification
    ComplianceVerifier -->|read / write| PropertyVerification
    ComplianceVerifier -->|verifyProof| LtvGroth16Verifier
    RoleAdminManager -->|roles| PropertyVerification
    RoleAdminManager -->|roles| Lending
  end

  Client -->|Registry and compliance requests| OffChain
  Client -->|Wallet: loan / admin actions and state reads| OnChain
  OffChain -->|Oracle: setVerified and proof submission| OnChain

